{
    "eo": {
        "Vegeta": "Vegeta",
        "And so he left, desperate and stronger.": "Kaj tiel li foriris, malespera kaj pli forta.",
        "KINGMOD_VEGETA_SKIN_DEFAULT": "Defauxlta",
        "KINGMOD_VEGETA_SKIN_BADMAN": "Badman",
        "Saiyan Blood": "Sango de Saiyan",
        "Skills also require <color=#03bcff>Ki</color> to be used!\nPerform a <color=#FF5400>Main Transformation</color> by tapping <color=#03f4fc>C</color> (View Transformations Tab for more info).\n<color=#FF5400>Power down</color> by tapping <color=#03f4fc>X</color>.\n<color=#FF5400>Fly</color> by holding <color=#03f4fc>Jump</color>.": "Kapabloj ankaux postulas <color=#03bcff>Ki</color> por esti uzataj!\nPlenumu <color=#FF5400>Cxefan Transformigxon</color> premante <color=#03f4fc>C</color> (Vidu la langeton pri Transformigxoj por pliaj informoj).\n<color=#FF5400>Malaktivigu formon</color> premante <color=#03f4fc>X</color>.\n<color=#FF5400>Flugu</color> tenante <color=#03f4fc>Salti</color>.",
        "Melee Strike": "Proksima Bato",
        "Deal <color=#E5C962>280% Damage</color> each strike!\nGain <color=#03bcff>9% Ki</color> Per Hit!\n<color=#03f4fc>Auto-moves to targeted enemies.</color>": "Kauxzas <color=#E5C962>280% da Damagxo</color> je cxiu bato!\nGajnu <color=#03bcff>9% da Ki</color> por Trafito!\n<color=#03f4fc>Auxtomate movigxas al celitaj malamikoj.</color>",
        "Continuous Energy Blast": "Dauxra Energia Eksplodo",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>10 Ki</color>\nConcentrate and rapidly fire Ki Blasts, Dealing <color=#E5C962>120% Damage</color> with each one!\n<color=#03f4fc>Holding this skill drains </color><color=#03bcff>18 Ki </color><color=#03f4fc>per second.</color>": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>10 Ki</color>\nKoncentrigxu kaj rapide pafu Ki-Pafajxojn, kauxzante <color=#E5C962>120% da Damagxo</color> per cxiu!\n<color=#03f4fc>Teni cxi tiun kapablon konsumas </color><color=#03bcff>18 Ki </color><color=#03f4fc>cxiusekunde.</color>",
        "Rising Sledgehammer": "Levigxanta Martelego",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>30 Ki</color>\nStrike and launch enemies upwards, dealing <color=#E5C962>400% Damage</color>!\nHolding the button follows-up with an additional downward strike, knocking-down enemies and dealing <color=#E5C962>1100% Damage</color>!\n": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>30 Ki</color>\nBatu kaj jxetu malamikojn supren, kauxzante <color=#E5C962>400% da Damagxo</color>!\nTenado de la butono sekvas per aldona malsuprenira bato, faligante malamikojn kaj kauxzante <color=#E5C962>1100% da Damagxo</color>!\n",
        "Empowered Ki Charge": "Plifortigita Ki-Sxargxo",
        "Hold and Regenerate <color=#03bcff>30% Ki</color> Per Second!": "Tenu kaj Regeneru <color=#03bcff>30% da Ki</color> Cxiusekunde!",
        "Flip": "Salto",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>20 Ki</color>\nPerform a quick flip in a direction.\n<color=#03f4fc>Gain Invulnerability whilst skill is active</color>": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>20 Ki</color>\nPlenumu rapidan kaptranssalton en direkto.\n<color=#03f4fc>Gajnu Nevundeblon dum la kapablo estas aktiva</color>",
        "Galick Gun": "Galick Gun",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>40 Ki</color>\nCharge and unleash a Galick Gun, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1500% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active! \nConsume additional Ki and increase damage by <color=#E5C962>800% Damage</color> per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>40 Ki</color>\nSxargxu kaj liberigu Galick Gun, kauxzante <color=#E5C962>1500% da Damagxo</color> cxiusekunde dum la radio estas aktiva! \nKonsumu aldonan Ki kaj pliigu damagxon je <color=#E5C962>800% da Damagxo</color> por sekundo da sxargxado!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki-konsumo iom post iom kreskas ju pli longe vi sxargxas!</color>",
        "Galaxy Breaker": "Galaxy Breaker",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>100 Ki</color>\nGenerate immense power to fire an energy wave upwards, dealing <color=#E5C962>3600% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active!\nConsume additional Ki and increase damage by <color=#E5C962>1600% Damage</color> and size per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>100 Ki</color>\nGeneru grandegan potencon por pafi energian ondon supren, kauxzante <color=#E5C962>3600% da Damagxo</color> cxiusekunde dum la radio estas aktiva!\nKonsumu aldonan Ki kaj pliigu damagxon je <color=#E5C962>1600% da Damagxo</color> kaj grandecon por sekundo da sxargxado!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki-konsumo iom post iom kreskas ju pli longe vi sxargxas!</color>",
        "Big Bang Attack": "Big Bang Attack",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>60 Ki</color>\nUnleash an explosive ball of energy! \nExplodes on hit, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1600% Damage</color>!\n": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>60 Ki</color>\nLiberigu eksplodeman globon de energio! \nEksplodas je trafo, kauxzante <color=#E5C962>1600% da Damagxo</color>!\n",
        "Final Flash": "Final Flash",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>120 Ki</color>\nCharge up and unleash a devastating Final Flash, Dealing <color=#E5C962>3000% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active!": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>120 Ki</color>\nSxargxu kaj liberigu detruan Final Flash, kauxzante <color=#E5C962>3000% da Damagxo</color> cxiusekunde dum la radio estas aktiva!",
        "Final Explosion": "Final Explosion",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>200 Ki</color>\nRelease a massively expanding explosion, Dealing <color=#E5C962>2500% Damage</color> and\ndraining <color=#03bcff>40% of Max Ki</color> per second!\n<color=#FF0000>Once Ki reaches 0, Health is drained instead, Can be fatal...</color>": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>200 Ki</color>\nLiberigu grandskale ekspansiigxantan eksplodon, kauxzante <color=#E5C962>2500% da Damagxo</color> kaj\nkonsumante <color=#03bcff>40% de Maks. Ki</color> cxiusekunde!\n<color=#FF0000>Kiam Ki atingas 0, Sano estas konsumata anstatauxe. Povas esti mortiga...</color>",
        "Prominence Flash": "Prominence Flash",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>200 Ki</color>\nCharge up and unleash a devastating God-level Prominence Flash, Dealing <color=#E5C962>4000% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active!": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>200 Ki</color>\nSxargxu kaj liberigu detruan Di-nivelan Prominence Flash, kauxzante <color=#E5C962>4000% da Damagxo</color> cxiusekunde dum la radio estas aktiva!",
        "Niagra Pummel": "Niagra Pummel",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>300 Ki</color>\nPower up and unleash a insanely fast barrage of strikes! \nDealing <color=#E5C962>222% Damage</color> for each one!\nFinishing it off with a powerful blow, Dealing <color=#E5C962>666% Damage</color>!": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>300 Ki</color>\nPlifortigxu kaj liberigu freneze rapidan sinsekvon de batoj! \nKauxzante <color=#E5C962>222% da Damagxo</color> por cxiu!\nFinante gxin per potenca bato, kauxzante <color=#E5C962>666% da Damagxo</color>!",
        "Full Power Final Explosion": "Full Power Final Explosion",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>400 Ki</color>\nRelease a massively expanding explosion,  Dealing <color=#E5C962>2700% Damage</color> and\ndraining <color=#03bcff>20% of Max Ki</color> per second!\n<color=#FF0000>Once Ki reaches 0, Health is drained instead, this version won't kill you...</color>": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>400 Ki</color>\nLiberigu grandskale ekspansiigxantan eksplodon, kauxzante <color=#E5C962>2700% da Damagxo</color> kaj\nkonsumante <color=#03bcff>20% de Maks. Ki</color> cxiusekunde!\n<color=#FF0000>Kiam Ki atingas 0, Sano estas konsumata anstatauxe, cxi tiu versio ne mortigos vin...</color>",
        "Final Shine Attack": "Final Shine Attack",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>80 Ki</color>\nUnleash a powerful Final Shine Attack, Dealing <color=#E5C962>3600% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active!": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>80 Ki</color>\nLiberigu potencan Final Shine Attack, kauxzante <color=#E5C962>3600% da Damagxo</color> cxiusekunde dum la radio estas aktiva!",
        "Super Galick Gun": "Super Galick Gun",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>300 Ki</color>\nCharge and unleash a Super Galick Gun, Dealing <color=#E5C962>8000% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active!": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>300 Ki</color>\nSxargxu kaj liberigu Super Galick Gun, kauxzante <color=#E5C962>8000% da Damagxo</color> cxiusekunde dum la radio estas aktiva!",
